  ('Dogs and cats', 2, 'Dogs and cats are welcome in sleeper cabins and grand sleepers when you book the whole cabin. A pet ticket costs €30 per animal, with a limit of two animals per cabin. Pets cannot travel in reclining seats or couchettes, because those spaces are shared.

Dogs must be on a lead in corridors and are not allowed in the dining car. The train stops for 15 minutes at Morrow Junction at about 23:40, which is the only chance for a walk before morning.'),
